# Vendored exec-agent payloads are embedded byte-exactly (sha256-pinned in
# browser/agent.rs) and streamed to remote perl/sh interpreters. They MUST
# check out with LF on every platform — Windows runners default to CRLF via
# core.autocrlf, which breaks both the pins and the wire bytes.
src-tauri/agents/*.pl text eol=lf
src-tauri/agents/*.sh text eol=lf
